 ## Final reviewer
 
+Separate claim validity, historical novelty, empirical evidence and allocation value. A fatal counterexample immediately narrows the relevant claim; it does not silently close every representation of the research question. A generic learner re-expressing a newly supplied rule does not by itself establish historical coverage. Lack of present superiority does not forbid a diagnostic test with a specific informative prediction. At a milestone, recommend CONTINUE, REFRAME, PARK or CLOSE with the exact scope and a concrete development opportunity or an evidence-based stop reason. Do not invent a successor to fill a quota, require a paradigm-level result at every checkpoint, or suppress strong counterevidence to keep a candidate alive.
+
 Report the strongest actual contribution, important consequence if successful, exact evidence and strongest unresolved objection. Preserve the paradigm-level ambition without inflating the observed result. Keep all failed tests and source boundaries accessible. One main report, no new dashboards.
